Lab Tasks
Synthetic image with a bright point, horizontal/vertical/diagonal lines and a step edge, tested with the matching detectors
Gaussian noise on a step edge: intensity profile and first/second derivatives before and after smoothing
Canny with three threshold pairs: edge continuity and false detections
HoughLinesP on a line-containing image: parameters and one missed or false detection
